OL,1,W5j 5Qwsj#%7k"k#j  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEurope is pouring billions into
OL,4,Aspace. Can Glasgow's satellite industry
OL,5,Akeep up?
OL,6,
OL,7,FI went to school not far from the River
OL,8,FClyde, where the city's shipbuilding
OL,9,Fheritage was forged, and knew Glasgow
OL,10,Fhad once been an industrial powerhouse.
OL,11,FWhen I was a child, "Clyde-built"
OL,12,Freally meant something: craftsmanship
OL,13,Fand engineering excellence. There was a
OL,14,Fsaying that I grew up with: "The Clyde
OL,15,Fmade Glasgow and Glasgow made the
OL,16,FClyde."
OL,18,FWhat I hadn't realised until recently
OL,19,Fwas that, in a different guise, that
OL,20,Ftradition is still alive. Two decades
OL,21,Flater, Glasgow is a European leader in
OL,22,Fbuilding small satellites.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
